Error [jet.UnknownHandler]: `route` `/` is not a statically known handler
  --> tests/ui/web_app_dynamic_route.jet:6:22
    |
  6 | fn run() { web.app().route("/", pick()).csr().serve() }
    |                      ^^^^^
 Why: Jet records every route and action on the typed application graph; a runtime-built handler outside `.mount` is an unanalyzed edge.
 Fix: Pass a named function, or declare `.mount(prefix, handler)` for dynamic subtrees.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E2810
